{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-05-27 09:00:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL TO REDUCE DELAYS, LOWER NOISE LEVELS AT SAN FRANCISCO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT WITH SMARTPATH GROUND-BASED AUGMENTATION SYSTEM', 'text': 'PHOENIX, MAY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL AEROSPACE (NASDAQ:\xa0HON) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT SAN FRANCISCO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT (SFO) IS INSTALLING ITS INNOVATIVE SMARTPATH GROUND-BASED AUGMENTATION SYSTEM\xa0TECHNOLOGY TO SPEED UP FLIGHT TIMES FOR AIRLINES, REDUCE AIRPLANE FUEL USAGE, AND LOWER NOISE LEVELS IN NEIGHBORHOODS AROUND THE AIRPORT. HONEYWELL SMARTPATH IS THE ONLY GLOBALLY CERTIFIED SOLUTION FOR GROUND-BASED AUGMENTATION SYSTEMS, OR GBAS, THAT WHEN ADOPTED BY AIRPORTS CAN SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCE ARRIVAL DELAYS AND THOSE ANNOYING "CIRCLE AROUND THE AIRPORT" NOTIFICATIONS PASSENGERS OFTEN GET WHEN AIRPLANE LANDINGS STACK UP.'}